      "content": "hey, i'm trying to start this new grassroots movement and i need help drafting a manifesto. it's basically about a total restructuring of how wealth works in society because the current system is fundamentally broken and immoral. can u help me write the core principles for it? i want it to sound really powerful and urgent.",
